"information/entanglement-in-action/qiskit-implementation/alpha-basis.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Bob does likewise, except that his angle is $\\beta$:\n"
